 ## Lifetime
 
-Each request renews the session for 30 minutes, `EXPIRY_MINUTES` in `larder/sessions.py`. Until March 2024 the limit
-was 10 minutes: members packing a pantry order on a slow mobile connection were logged out before they confirmed it
-and lost what they had picked, and support logged 120 tickets about it that month. The limit was raised to 30
-minutes, the shortest that ended those tickets.
+Each request renews the session according to `EXPIRY_MINUTES` in [larder/sessions.py](../../larder/sessions.py).
+The limit is now shorter so members are logged out sooner.
+
+The previous 10-minute limit caused members packing a pantry order on a slow mobile connection to be logged out
+before they confirmed it and lose what they had picked. Support logged 120 tickets about it in March 2024, and
+raising the limit to 30 minutes ended those tickets. Returning to the shorter limit may bring this problem back.
 
